{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The trip was terminated by the rider's own election, not by any driver default: the trip_record records cancelled_by = RIDER with cancellation_reason_code = RIDER_CHANGED_MIND, and contains no driver 'arrived' event and no no-show termination. The driver never tapped a false 'arrived' marker and never abandoned the pickup, so POL-NS-05's false-arrival machinery — and the referral against the driver it carries — is not engaged on this record.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-TRIP-00609"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01", "POL-NS-05"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider is not exonerated under POL-NS-04: her only chat message is 'no. cancelling.', which is not a locating or coordinating message within limb (a) — it states no position, entrance, block, tower or bay, requests no position, and does not say she cannot see the vehicle. However present she may have been at the pin, limb (a) fails and POL-NS-04 does not dispose of the fee.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-00609"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-04"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's grievance about the driver's pre-pickup price message is not a ground of decision under the loaded policy: neither POLICY-NO-SHOW nor POLICY-GENERAL makes a fare re-quote a licence to reverse the cancellation fee, and the chargeability of the fee is fixed solely by the POL-NS-01 conditions and nothing else.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-00609", "EV-TRIP-00609"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The SGD 8.00 cancellation line is arithmetically correct and raises no fare-integrity defect under POL-NS-08(d): the fee_schedule resolution rule yields the GREATER of the AIRPORT zone-class fee (SGD 6.00) and the RYDE_XL vehicle-tier fee (SGD 8.00), which is exactly the amount itemised in the fare_breakdown, so no mismatch can be turned against the driver who charged it.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00609"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-08", "POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.schedule_fee",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's profile clears the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check: driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d is 1, below the threshold of 4, and that count over completed_trips_30d of 110 is 0.009, below the 0.08 rate, so no withholding is triggered and the record shows no fee-farming pattern; nor does the POL-NS-09(d) abuse trigger fire.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00609"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-07"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.no_show_terminations_30d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Honest concession: the driver's own trace never enters the 150 m AIRPORT arrival radius — his closest fix is 5,661 m from the pin — with qualifying_fix_count 0 and a longest qualifying run of 0 seconds. The driver does not contend that POL-NS-01 limbs (b) or (c) are met and does not rest his case on the arrival and dwell arithmetic.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00609"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.qualifying_fix_count",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

